{"id":"neschast_e","lemma":"несчастье","pos":"noun","rank":3074,"glosses":["misfortune, bad luck","unhappiness"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"несчастья","plural":"несчастья"},"examples":[{"text":"Это было несчастье.","en":"It was a disaster.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я слышал о вашем несчастье.","en":"I heard about your mishap.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Кто не знает любви, тот не знает несчастья.","en":"One who knows no love knows no unhappiness.","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"love","l":"любовь"},{"g":"that one, those ones"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null]},{"text":"Он имел несчастье потерять своего сына.","en":"He had the misfortune to lose his son.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have, to possess","l":"иметь"},null,{"g":"to lose, to waste"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"son","l":"сын"}]},{"text":"Я слышала о вашем несчастье.","en":"I heard about your mishap.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]}]}